{
  "name": "shuangtian",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "kind": "static_library",
  "cxx_standard": 23,
  "include_dirs": ["include", "third_party", "third_party/sqlite"],
  "modules": ["core", "math", "codec", "raster", "text", "md", "xml", "ui", "shell", "control", "app", "pkg", "ext", "edit", "lsp"],
  "sources": [
    "src/core/*.cpp",
    "src/math/*.cpp",
    "src/codec/*.cpp",
    "src/raster/*.cpp",
    "src/text/*.cpp",
    "src/md/*.cpp",
    "src/xml/*.cpp",
    "src/ui/*.cpp",
    "src/ui/components/*.cpp",
    "src/shell/*.cpp",
    "src/control/*.cpp",
    "src/app/*.cpp",
    "src/net/*.cpp",
    "src/pkg/*.cpp",
    "src/ext/*.cpp",
    "src/edit/*.cpp",
    "src/lsp/*.cpp"
  ],
  "embed": ["src/ui/script_api.js", "src/ui/declarative.js"],
  "third_party_sources": ["third_party/quickjs/*.c", "third_party/sqlite/*.c"],
  "c_flags": ["-std=gnu11", "-include", "st_sqlite3_config.h"],
  "tests": ["tests/*_test.cpp"],
  "flags": [
    "-fno-strict-aliasing",
    "-Wall",
    "-Wextra",
    "-Werror",
    "-Wconversion",
    "-Wshadow",
    "-Wpedantic",
    "-Wold-style-cast",
    "-Wnon-virtual-dtor",
    "-Wcast-align",
    "-Wnull-dereference",
    "-Woverloaded-virtual",
    "-Wdouble-promotion",
    "-Wimplicit-fallthrough"
  ],
  "defines": ["ST_VERSION=\"0.1.0\"", "ST_ENABLE_LINT=1"],
  "lint": {
    "//": "规则豁免：规则 id → 路径 glob。成片/基于位置的边界走这里（单点破例走行内 // lint-allow）。两通道都需在 CONVENTIONS.md §8 登记，且各自计数、不静默。",
    "exempt": {
      "L14": ["src/core/entry.cpp", "tools/*_probe.cpp"],
      "L3": ["src/net/platform_tls_openssl.cpp", "tests/shard_parity_test.cpp"],
      "//probe": "量测探针（tools/*_probe.cpp）是**一次性量尺**、不是交付物：用 std::printf 输出数字、直接 include 系统头拿 ABI。它们不进任何 target 产物、不被应用包含，按 CONVENTIONS §8 做成片豁免。",
      "L7": ["tools/*_probe.cpp"],
      "L6": ["tools/*_probe.cpp"]
    }
  },
  "//system_libs": "本机（非交叉）链接用的库。注意与 `toolchains.<名>.system_libs` 的分工：后者在**交叉编译**时**整体接管**（见 `resolve_system_libraries`），本机构建根本不看它。所以 Win32 相关的系统库（dbghelp 供崩溃调用栈符号化）两处都要写。",
  "system_libs": ["pthread", "dl", "m", "ws2_32", "user32", "gdi32", "shell32", "dbghelp", "nanosrv", "psapi", "secur32", "winpthread"],
  "toolchains": {
    "mingw": {
      "compiler": "x86_64-w64-mingw32-g++",
      "c_compiler": "x86_64-w64-mingw32-gcc",
      "platform": "windows",
      "//system_libs_note": "交叉接管用（resolve_system_libraries：声明即整体接管不追默认）。与 link-libs.txt 的 windows 节的**差异是有意的**：nanosrv 不在——它只在本机 MSYS2 MinGW 里需要（那里的 libdbghelp.a 只是转发壳）；mingw-w64 交叉包（Ubuntu 等）的 libdbghelp.a 自带真符号（实测 nm 可见 SymInitialize/SymFromAddr），再链 nanosrv 反而 cannot find -lnanosrv。",
      "system_libs": ["ws2_32", "user32", "gdi32", "shell32", "dbghelp", "psapi", "secur32", "winpthread"],
      "defines": ["_WIN32_WINNT=0x0A00", "WINVER=0x0A00", "NTDDI_VERSION=0x0A000006"],
      "//defines_note": "NTDDI_VERSION 必须给到 RS5(0x0A000006)：ConPTY 的 HPCON/CreatePseudoConsole 在 mingw-w64 的 wincon.h 里由 #if (NTDDI_VERSION >= 0x0A000006) 门控。旧值 0x0A000000 会让 platform_pty.cpp 编不过（HPCON has not been declared）——本机 Windows MinGW 因更高默认 SDK 值而看不出来，Linux 交叉首次实编时现形。",
      "executable_suffix": ".exe",
      "extra_flags": ["-static-libgcc", "-static-libstdc++"]
    },
    "clang": {
      "//": "Clang 作为第二编译器（与 g++ 同一条口径：GCC 风格标志 + libstdc++ 运行库）。",
      "//target": "**必须显式给三元组**：clang++ 的默认目标跟着它自己的构建方式走（LLVM 官方 Windows 包是 MSVC 目标，会去要 Visual Studio 的头与库）；给成 gnu 就吃 MinGW 的 libstdc++，不依赖 VS。",
      "//path": "绝对路径指向本地 LLVM 安装（LLVM 官方包不含 libc++，所以必须配 target_triple 才有 STL）。换机器时改这两行。",
      "compiler": "C:/Users/Administrator/program/clang+llvm-23.1.2/bin/clang++.exe",
      "c_compiler": "C:/Users/Administrator/program/clang+llvm-23.1.2/bin/clang.exe",
      "target_triple": "x86_64-w64-windows-gnu",
      "platform": "windows",
      "//system_libs_note": "同上：与 link-libs.txt 的 windows 节同步。",
      "system_libs": ["ws2_32", "user32", "gdi32", "shell32", "dbghelp", "nanosrv", "psapi", "secur32", "winpthread"],
      "defines": ["_WIN32_WINNT=0x0A00", "WINVER=0x0A00", "NTDDI_VERSION=0x0A000006"],
      "//defines_note": "NTDDI_VERSION 必须给到 RS5(0x0A000006)：ConPTY 的 HPCON/CreatePseudoConsole 在 mingw-w64 的 wincon.h 里由 #if (NTDDI_VERSION >= 0x0A000006) 门控。旧值 0x0A000000 会让 platform_pty.cpp 编不过（HPCON has not been declared）——本机 Windows MinGW 因更高默认 SDK 值而看不出来，Linux 交叉首次实编时现形。",
      "//suppressions": "对 clang 的告警收敛，全部来自 **vendored 第三方头**（sqlite3.h 用 MSVC 扩展类型 __int64、quickjs.h 用旧式转换与 NAN）——那是上游代码，不是我们要改的东西。工程自己的代码仍与 gcc 同等严格。",
      "suppressions": ["-Wno-language-extension-token", "-Wno-old-style-cast", "-Wno-double-promotion"],
      "executable_suffix": ".exe"
    }
  },
  "targets": {
    "st_core": { "kind": "library",
                 "include_sources": ["src/core/*.cpp", "src/codec/*.cpp", "src/math/*.cpp",
                                     "src/net/*.cpp", "src/xml/*.cpp", "src/test/*.cpp",
                                     "src/edit/*.cpp", "src/lsp/*.cpp", "src/pkg/*.cpp"],
                 "//include_sources": "**通用层**：这些模块的 .cpp 实测**不（传递地）触及 `st/ui/` 或 `st/raster/`**（逐个模块做头文件传递闭包算出来的），所以可以单独成库给非 GUI 程序用。改这些模块以外的代码不会触发本库重建。\n\n`lsp` 与 `pkg` 原本因经 `ext/json.hpp` 传递依赖被挡在外面——2026-10-26 把 json 归位到 `core/` 后它们不再触及 UI，于是入列（8 → 10 个模块）。",
                 "inherit_project_embed": false,
                 "//inherit_project_embed": "工程级 embed 是 UI 的 `script_api.js`/`declarative.js`——通用库不该带它们（实测 `ar t` 里能看到 `ui_declarative_js.cpp.o` 混进来）。",
                 "system_libs": ["dl"] },
    "st": { "kind": "executable",
            "sources": ["tools/stpm/*.cpp", "src/ui/window_control.cpp"],
            "include_sources": ["src/pkg/*.cpp",
                                "src/core/*.cpp",
                                "src/ext/database.cpp", "src/ext/script.cpp"],
            "//include_sources": "**白名单**：本目标只编这些库级源，`src/**` 其余一概不进。\n\n为何用白名单：`exclude_sources` 是黑名单，漏一条就多编几个无关单元，而构建照常成功、**静默变胖**——只能靠人把每条间接依赖都推一遍。实测代价：原先逐项排了 13 条，仍因 `src/ui/window_control.cpp` 间接依赖 `math/geometry.hpp` 把 math 拉了回来。白名单相反：漏写会链接报错（可发现）。\n\n口径来源：编译器产出的 `tools_stpm_main.cpp.o.d` 实测只有 **23 个依赖头，全部来自 core/pkg/ext**。\n\n不在白名单里的（raster/text/md/xml/net/shell/math/codec/ext-video 与应用层）都不参与——改这些文件时**不再触发 st 自举**。\n\n⚠ `src/ext/video.cpp` 不能加：它需要 `raster::Canvas`（视频解码回帧）。",
            "//sources": "`tools/stpm` 是入口；`src/ui/window_control.cpp` 是壳层边缘命中契约（`platform_win32.cpp` 用它）。",
            "system_libs": ["dl"] },
    "crash_probe": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["tools/crash_probe.cpp"],
                     "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "gallery": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["examples/gallery/*.cpp"],
                 "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"],
                 "embed": ["examples/gallery/assets/*"] },
    "gbcode": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["examples/gbcode/*.cpp"],
                  "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"],
                  "//system": "GUI 子系统：双击 exe 不弹控制台窗口（PE Subsystem=2）。\n工具链 st 与探测程序保持 console——它们要在终端里跑并读输出。",
                  "system": "gui",
                  "//icon": "exe **文件**图标。资源管理器/任务栏/快捷方式看到的是它；\n运行期 SetWindowIcon 换的是窗口图标，两者不是一回事。\n由 tools/make_ico.py 从 gbcode-icon.png 生成（多尺寸）。",
                  "icon": "examples/gbcode/assets/gbcode.ico",
                  "//embed": "逐项列出而不用 `assets/*`：`.ico` 是给编译器进 PE 资源的，\n不是 battery::embed 的嵌入项（二进制且体积大，嵌进去只是白胖）。",
                  "embed": ["examples/gbcode/assets/gbcode-icon.png",
                              "examples/gbcode/assets/gbcode-logo.svg",
                              "examples/gbcode/assets/icons.svg"] },
    "louyue": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["examples/louyue/*.cpp"],
                  "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"],
                  "embed": ["examples/louyue/assets/*"] },
    "caiyun": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["examples/caiyun/*.cpp"],
                  "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"],
                  "//note": "裁云视频渲染：JSON 骨架 + 可选 JS 编排层（layout.js 每帧求值）" },
    "xmlapp": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["examples/xmlapp/*.cpp"],
                  "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"],
                  "//note": "纯 XML+JS 示例：界面在 ui/main.xml、逻辑在 ui/app.js（都是运行期读，不 embed）",
                  "embed": [] },
    "xiangqi": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["examples/xiangqi/*.cpp"],
                  "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"],
                  "//note": "agent 控制的桌面常驻面板：webSocket 客户端连控制器；界面 ui/main.xml、逻辑 ui/app.js（运行期读，不 embed）",
                  "embed": [] },
    "caret_ink_probe": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["tools/caret_ink_probe.cpp"],
                         "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "menu_clip_probe": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["tools/menu_clip_probe.cpp"],
                         "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"],
                         "//note": "MenuPanel 视口剔除的像素等价性验证（见源文件头部）" },
    "pty_stop_probe": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["tools/pty_stop_probe.cpp"],
                        "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "pty_form_probe": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["tools/pty_form_probe.cpp"],
                         "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "font_stack_probe": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["tools/font_stack_probe.cpp"],
                          "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "bold_face_probe": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["tools/bold_face_probe.cpp"],
                         "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"],
                         "//note": "探本机是否有真粗体面：决定禁用合成加粗后 bold 会不会退化" },
    "text_bold_sharpness_probe": { "kind": "executable",
                                   "sources": ["tools/text_bold_sharpness_probe.cpp"],
                                   "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"],
                                   "//note": "真粗体面 vs Regular 的墨量分层：把“糊/脏”变成可量的数" },
    "lsp_parse_probe": { "kind": "executable",
                          "sources": ["tools/lsp_parse_probe.cpp"],
                          "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "lsp_symbols_probe": { "kind": "executable",
                            "sources": ["tools/lsp_symbols_probe.cpp", "examples/gbcode/lsp_bridge.cpp"],
                            "extra_include_dirs": ["."],
                            "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "port_isolation_probe": { "kind": "executable",
                              "sources": ["tools/port_isolation_probe.cpp"],
                              "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "lock_contention_probe": { "kind": "executable",
                               "sources": ["tools/lock_contention_probe.cpp"],
                               "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "font_thread_safety_probe": { "kind": "executable",
                                   "sources": ["tools/font_thread_safety_probe.cpp"],
                                   "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "md_async_bench": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["tools/md_async_bench.cpp"],
                        "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "ring_path_probe": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["tools/ring_path_probe.cpp"],
                         "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "ring_raster_probe": { "kind": "executable", "sources": ["tools/ring_raster_probe.cpp"],
                           "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"] },
    "rounded_fill_probe": {
      "kind": "executable",
      "sources": ["tools/rounded_fill_probe.cpp"],
      "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"]
    },
    "sprite_equiv_probe": {
      "kind": "executable",
      "sources": ["tools/sprite_equiv_probe.cpp"],
      "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"]
    },
    "shadow_covered_probe": {
      "kind": "executable",
      "sources": ["tools/shadow_covered_probe.cpp"],
      "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"]
    },
    "shadow_inside_ratio": {
      "kind": "executable",
      "sources": ["tools/shadow_inside_ratio.cpp"],
      "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"]
    },
    "overdraw_probe": {
      "kind": "executable",
      "sources": ["tools/overdraw_probe.cpp"],
      "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"]
    },
    "round_rect_cost_probe": {
      "kind": "executable",
      "sources": ["tools/round_rect_cost_probe.cpp"],
      "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"]
    },
    "round_rect_fixed_cost_probe": {
      "kind": "executable",
      "sources": ["tools/round_rect_fixed_cost_probe.cpp"],
      "exclude_sources": ["src/pkg/*"]
    },
    "mul255_equiv_probe": {
      "kind": "executable",
      "sources": ["tools/mul255_equiv_probe.cpp"],
